{"signature": "0494af0c3c9ef988c4281c7241d59611f427d337ec58c7725e8a721f13320428", "result": {"checks": {"check": {"scope": {"id": "check", "service": "linear", "file": "data.json", "pointer": "/issues", "field": "identifier", "values": ["ENG-2292", "ENG-2323", "ZOM-386", "ZOM-412", "ZOM-436"]}, "matches": [{"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2227", "field": "identifier", "value": "ENG-2292", "record": {"id": "ENG-2292", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_cc3e90160f490686", "creator_id": "usr_63fffeb4fab5233e", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2292", "number": 2292, "title": "Silent Removal of Interstitials", "description": "We will silently remove interstitial ads based on a tiered system tied to the player\u2019s total lifetime value (LTV):\n\n* **LTV > $0 but < $0.99** \u2192 No interstitial ads for **1 week**\n* **LTV $0.99 \u2013 $2.99** \u2192 No interstitial ads for **1 month**\n* **LTV $2.99 \u2013 $5.00** \u2192 No interstitial ads for **3 months**\n* **LTV > $5.00** \u2192 Interstitial ads are **permanently removed**\n\nThis logic runs silently in the background and requires no user-facing messaging.", "priority": 1, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-04-21T18:32:54Z", "completed_at": "2025-10-27T11:23:35Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 157451, "labels": ["Global Launch"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-04-18T17:14:17Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-27T11:23:35Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2262", "field": "identifier", "value": "ENG-2323", "record": {"id": "ENG-2323", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_4e13bd40cc73d0fc", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2323", "number": 2323, "title": "Add Hero Offers to Shop", "description": "The game currently lacks hero-based offer in the shop because players are not buying pop up offers. So we need to have a hero offer in the shop by giving random hero tokens. \n\nStatic shop offer with different color variants. @Martin.Walsh \n\n**WIP**\n\n![image.png]([URL_52446])\n\nFor that, \n\n1. Implement Hero Offer items (the items except hero tokens)\n2. Implement random token drop chance (only with the unlocked heroes)\n3. After successful purchase, trigger the chest animation to show which hero tokens are granted. Something like tavern chest animation. \n\n[ScreenRecording_[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_6215]_1.MP4]([URL_52445])", "priority": 1, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-05-07T17:50:06Z", "completed_at": "2025-05-13T17:03:17Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 397591, "labels": ["Hot Fix - Global Launch"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-05-01T13:43:47Z", "updated_at": "2025-05-13T17:03:17Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3510", "field": "identifier", "value": "ZOM-386", "record": {"id": "ZOM-386", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_cd7849ec043ab3da", "creator_id": "usr_63fffeb4fab5233e", "state_id": "Todo", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-386", "number": 386, "title": "Track Player Card Inventory and Sync to BigQuery", "description": "### **Requirements:**\n\n#### **1. Inventory Data Capture on Player Login to the backend:**\n\n* When a player logs into the backend, capture and send the following for each card:\n  * `player_id`\n  * `card_id` (integer)\n  * `card_level`\n    * `0` = Not owned / Locked\n    * `1-5` = Owned, corresponds to card level\n  * `timestamp` of the login\n\n#### **2. BigQuery Sync:**\n\n* Send this card inventory data to **BigQuery once per day**, ideally on first login of the day.\n* Each row in the table should represent a unique player\u2013card inventory.\n\n#### **3. Lookup Table for Card Metadata:**\n\n* Create a **separate BigQuery table** mapping `card_id` \u2192 `card_name` (or human-readable identifier).\n\n---\n\n### **Data Schema:**\n\n**Player Card Inventory Table (card_inventory):**\n\n`player_id (string) card_id (int) card_level (int) timestamp (datetime)`\n\n**Card Metadata Table (card_metadata) :**\n\n`card_id (int) card_name (string)`\n\nThis will allow us to query and segment players by card ownership and progression, and support future features such as dynamic offers, A/B tests, and balancing decisions.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 307744, "labels": ["Inventory", "Data"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-07-15T02:30:23Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-15T02:30:23Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3539", "field": "identifier", "value": "ZOM-412", "record": {"id": "ZOM-412", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-402", "assignee_id": "usr_49b9dfa5208d400d", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-412", "number": 412, "title": "Daily login unlock needs to move from level 25 complete to level 24 complete", "description": "[ScreenRecording_[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_6306]_1.MP4]([URL_52717])", "priority": 3, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2025-07-22T07:40:20Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2026-02-02T04:54:03Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 297354, "labels": ["Improvement"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2025-07-21T15:05:24Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-22T07:40:20Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3564", "field": "identifier", "value": "ZOM-436", "record": {"id": "ZOM-436", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_bdf01b53c6a92c5e", "creator_id": "usr_63fffeb4fab5233e", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-436", "number": 436, "title": "Analytics instrumentation for all tutorial steps", "description": "Some tutorial steps are hooked to the analytics and are now sending step_name_str. Please make sure all tutorial steps including booster tutorials, pre_booster, win_Streak etc. send these steps as well so we know if users are having issues passing those steps.", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2025-09-17T15:42:16Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 214792, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-07-27T00:04:50Z", "updated_at": "2025-09-17T15:42:16Z"}}], "records_checked": 3852, "files_selected": 1, "files_completed": 1, "scan_complete": true, "errors": []}}, "files_read_this_call": 1, "sources": [{"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "manifest_sha256": "b299d01377efd99db02ba7f6bb072a6d539b00d970b492b9e79b68353d3f5310", "freshness": "582618486f6bf42cadf2f5773c59d065e6e938d2e6a872db0c1e27305c9165fd"}], "scan_complete": true, "persona_filtered": false, "backend": "grouped-record-scan", "scope_note": "Exact direct fields in selected arrays. No SQL is applied. Absence/uniqueness is supported only within complete declared scopes. Manifest hashes are declared provenance, not fresh full-content hashes."}, "checksum": "80728fd6d7b756878705b3f47284c377f8cf40d87af641097826016a194acee4"}